  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(a) Haber&#39;s process is used for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;synthesis.</p><p>(b) Ostwald&#39;s process is used for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;synthesis.</p><p>(c) Contact process is used for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;synthesis.</p><p>(d) In Hall-Heroult process, electrolytic reduction of impure alumina can be done. (Aluminium extraction)</p>"
